Package: delphir
Title: Structured Delphi and RAND/UCLA Analysis for Consensus Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Delphi", "Methodology Group", email = "delphir@example.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Protocol-first toolkit for Delphi studies, RAND/UCLA
    appropriateness panels, and COMET core outcome set surveys.
    Locks consensus rules before analysis, summarises ordinal ratings
    with medians and agreement rates, classifies items, assesses
    between-round stability, prepares controlled feedback, and writes
    ACCORD, DCAT and CREDES aligned reports.
